          {
            "title": "Question: Functions that return values",
            "id": 87023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değer döndüren fonksiyonlar hangi fiillerle başlayabilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code>, <code>get</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>has</code>, <code>is</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code>, <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değer döndüren fonksiyonlar genellikle <code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code> veya <code>get</code> gibi fiillerle başlar.</p><p>Bir siparişin toplamını hesaplayıp döndüren fonksiyona hangi ad en uygundur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>calculate_total()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_total()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>total()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>calculate_total()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function that returns booleans",
            "id": 87024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Boolean değer döndüren fonksiyonlar hangi fiillerle başlayabilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is</code>, <code>has</code>, <code>can</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get</code>, <code>make</code>, <code>calculate</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>is</code>, <code>has</code>, <code>can</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Boolean değer döndüren fonksiyonlar genellikle <code>is</code>, <code>has</code> veya <code>can</code> ile başlar.</p><p>Bir kullanıcının erişimi olup olmadığını döndüren fonksiyona hangi ad en uygundur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>has_access()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_access()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>calculate_access()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>has_access()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Same naming practice",
            "id": 87025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aynı fonksiyon adlandırmasını korumak ne anlama gelir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Benzer görevleri gerçekleştiren fonksiyonlar için aynı fiili kullanmak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonların ne yaptığına bakılmaksızın aynı fiili kullanma</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Benzer görevleri gerçekleştiren fonksiyonlar için aynı fiili kullanmak.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tutarlı adlandırma, benzer görevleri yapan fonksiyonlar için aynı fiili kullanmak demektir.</p><p>Bir projede <code>load_profile()</code> var. Ayarları yükleyen benzer bir fonksiyona hangi ad en uygundur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>load_settings()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_settings()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>settings_load()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>load_settings()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Descriptive names",
            "id": 87026,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir öğeyi ve fiyatını görüntüleyen bu fonksiyona açıklayıcı bir ad ver.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_item_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\": $\" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display_item_price(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_item\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"chocolate: $3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>display_item_price</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyon bir ürünü ve fiyatını gösteriyor. İkisinden de söz eden bir ad verip aynı adla çağır. Fonksiyon <code>chocolate: $3</code> yazdırır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_item_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\": $\" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display_item_price(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_item\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"chocolate: $3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>display_item_price</code>, ardından <code>display_item_price</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Verb",
            "id": 87027,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyonun adının bir fiille başladığından emin ol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"generate_username\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, b_day)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"_\" /><text value=\"{b_day}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = generate_username(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"ty_17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>generate</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyonun adı bir fiille başlamalı. Çağrıda da aynı ön eki kullan. Fonksiyon <code>ty_17</code> yazdırır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"generate_username\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, b_day)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"_\" /><text value=\"{b_day}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = generate_username(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"ty_17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>generate</code>, ardından <code>generate</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Functions that return values",
            "id": 87032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
